 "v2_problem": "Billing dispute tickets surged from a ~600/month baseline to 1180 (Aug) and 1260 (Sep 2026) (E-03) because rule BV-17, deployed 2026-08-01, compares raw AMI register values to 12-month m3 history with unit_scaling=none (E-13); firmware v4.2 meters (rollout 2026-06) report readings in 0.1 m3 units (E-14), so their valid high-consumption reads are misflagged and rejected at import (REJECTED_HIGH_CONSUMPTION, 1184 of 1240 ESTIMATED-read disputed bills, 95.5%, E-12), forcing estimate substitution and wrong bills customers dispute.",
